The tenant filter is constructed in the **`TenantFilter`** class inside **`src/Maf.Lab.Retrieval/Store/TenantScopedSearch.cs`**.

* The class is defined at lines 121‑123 with the comment “Builds the tenant filter. The only producer of tenant conditions in the codebase.”  
